Intetics Inc. is a leading American technology company providing custom software application development, distributed professional teams creation, software product quality assessment, and “all-things-digital” solutions, is looking for a Python Developer to enrich its team with a skilled professional.
Responsibilities:

• Collaborate closely with CTO and founding engineer who are an expert in full stack development;

• Develop maintainable Python / FastAPI backends for API;

• Leverage AWS cloud services to enable complex workflow engine;

• Building backend for large language model app on AWS cloud;

• Work with Front-end engineers and product manager to deliver key backend functionality at a fast pace.

Requirements

• 4+ year experience with Python

• Experience with Rest service frameworks such as Django, Flask, FastAPI (we are using FastAPI on our production);

• Deep understanding toward ORM and data modeling and management tools SQLAlchemy , Alembic, Pydantic etc.

• Past experience on AWS lambda and Stepfunction to manage workflow engine; managing cloud stack through infrastructure as code (IaC) framework such as CDK / Terraform is a huge plus;

• Strong background in TDD practice and expert level of driving TDD product building using frameworks such as pyTest, etc.

• Self-motivated and accountable, with a penchant for delivering high-caliber software;

• Ability to thrive in a fast-paced setting;

• Fluent in English.

